Adobe CMap resources
================================================================================

Files:   internal/cjk/data/*.bin
Derived from the cid2code.txt tables of the Adobe-Japan1-7, Adobe-GB1-6,
Adobe-CNS1-7, Adobe-Korea1-2 and Adobe-KR-9 character collections by
internal/cjk/gen.go. Only the CID column, the Unicode columns and the columns
of the legacy CMaps are used, re-encoded in a compact binary form. No Adobe
source code is included.
