Adobe Core 14 font metrics
================================================================================

File:    internal/font/std14.go
Derived from the Adobe Core 14 AFM files by internal/font/gen_std14.go. Only
the advance width of each glyph is used, keyed by the Unicode character the
glyph name stands for. The AFM files themselves are not included.
